# ── Personal credentials (git name, email) ──────────────────────────────────
private.nix

# ── Machine-specific files (generated by nixos-generate-config) ──────────────
# Each user must regenerate hardware-configuration.nix for their own machine.
# See setup.sh for instructions.
hardware-configuration.nix

# ── User preferences (generated by setup.sh) ─────────────────────────────────
# Contains your chosen username. Do not commit — use user-config.example.nix as reference.
user-config.nix

# ── Runtime artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc
